~ start

$> Global.expression = "happy" 
Mina: Hey, Violet 
Mina: What would you like to talk about?
- day (+ 15 :) )
	$> Global.expression = "serious"
	=> day
- work (+ 1 HW) [if Global.pages_done < Global.lessons]
	$> Global.expression = "laugh"
	Mina: You're behind on work again, huh?
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Mina: Ok, let me summarise this topic for you!
	Mina: ...
	$> Global.expression = "elated"
	Mina: And here are the answers to the problems you've provided
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Mina: ...
	$> Global.expression = "laugh"
	Mina: Is that all?
	- yes, thank you
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Mina: Your welcome! [$> Global.pages_done += 1]
- open up (+ 30 :) ) [if not Global.open_up] 
	$> Global.expression = "serious"
	=> open_up

=> END

~ day
$> Global.happiness += 15
#% 
