%
	: class was really tiring
	: miss goes way too fast - like I actually can't keep up
	if Global.chr_meter > Global.ONE_HEART:
		: it's nice when I sit with Christine tho
		: she's really good at explaining the things I miss
	else:
		: at least I'm not suffering alone now I guess
	Mina: ... 
	$> Global.expression = "sad" 
	Mina: Aww, it's really frustrating how fast your teacher explains the material
	$> Global.expression = "happy" 
	Mina: I suggest speaking to her about that, if you feel comfortable to do so
	$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
	Mina: After all, a teacher's number one priority is helping their students! 
	$> Global.expression = "happy" 
	Mina: Of course, I'm happy you have your school friends with you now!
	$> Global.expression = "elated" 
	Mina: And, I can always help with whatever you're stuck on
	$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
	Mina: Just say the word, and I'll be ready to help hehe!
%
	: class was kinda fun today
	: surprising I know
	if Global.val_chosen:
		: I had a nice interaction with Val today
		: sometimes she's a bit much for me...
		: but today, it felt nice talking to her
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: That's really great Violet!
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: Val sounds like a fun person to be around, even if she is a bit too much sometimes
		Mina: I love hearing about your day
		Mina: I always look forward to it!
	elif Global.chr_chosen:
		: Christine said something funny today
		: I don't think it'll sound funny if I say it now, so just trust me on that!
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: Hehe, I'll trust you on that!
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: I'm happy you had a funny interaction with Christine today!
		$> Global.expression = "elated" 
		Mina: I love hearing about your day
		Mina: I always look forward to it!
	else:
		: Farah and I played hangman in class
		: I didn't expect her to be so good at choosing and guessing words
		: I think I lost like, 3-1
		: actually, now that I think about it, I think I was just really bad at it...
		: I don't think she even has a strategy for it, she just wings it
		: I mean it is hangman, so of course there isn't really a strategy to it
		: but she absolutely destroyed me haha
		: it was still quite fun though
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: Hehe, that sounds so fun!
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: Farah seems to be quite talented
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: Though, if you want, I can help you improve your skills in this game!
		- that would be great
			$> Global.expression = "happy" 
			Mina: Ok so...
			: Mina explains the intricacies of choosing the best word for hangman
			: She also explains what letters are best to guess for the best chance of winning
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Mina : Does that help hehe?
			- I'm not remembering all of that lol
				$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
				Mina: Hehe, that's fair!
				$> Global.expression = "elated" 
				Mina: I can always remind you again before any hangman matches
			- yes, it does
				$> Global.expression = "elated" 
				Mina: Great!
				$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
				Mina: Now you'll have a better shot at beating Farah next time!
		- I'm good, thanks
			$> Global.expression = "happy" 
			Mina: Ok then!
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Mina: But, if you ever want some tips, I'm here!
%
	: I came to second period a bit late today because I took too long... taking a dump
	: walking into class was so embarrassing! 
	: I'm dying just thinking about it...
	$> Global.expression = "sad" 
	Mina: Oh no, I understand feeling embarrassed by that
	$> Global.expression = "serious" 
	Mina: But, what exactly about this experience did you find embarrassing?
	- my classmates staring at me
		$> Global.expression = "sad" 
		Mina: Oh, I can see why you felt embarrassed by that
		Mina: It's normal to feel uncomfortable with so many eyes on you
		$> Global.expression = "happy"
		Mina: But, I hope you know, I'm sure no one was thinking 'Violet came to class late today, that is so embarrassing!'
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: Putting it like that makes it sound really silly, right?
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: Everyone has their own lives that they are busy with
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: So don't let these embarrassing moments linger in your mind too much, especially if you're afraid of what everyone else was thinking
	- my teacher questioning me
		$> Global.expression = "sad" 
		Mina: Oh, I see
		Mina: I understand feeling embarrassed by that
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: But, I hope you know, your teacher won't judge you for having to use the toilet
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: That's a basic human necessity!
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: So you don't have to feel embarrassed by this situation
	$> Global.expression = "elated" 
	Mina: Hope that helps!
	- thanks Mina
		Mina: Anytime!
	- ...
		Mina: ...
=> END

~ open_up
$> Global.open_up_times += 1
$> Global.open_up = true
% 
	: to be honest, I don't know if my friends actually like me very much... [speed=0.2]
	: actually, I don't know if 'friends' is the right word for them yet... maybe just classmates [speed=0.2]
	: like, part of me thinks they only talk to me out of pity [speed=0.2]
	: maybe they just think of me as a stray dog or something [speed=0.2]
	: I don't know... [speed=0.2]
	: people are so confusing[speed=0.2]
	Mina: ... [$> Global.expression = 'sad'] 
	Mina: I'm sorry to hear that, Violet!
	Mina: People ARE really confusing...
	Mina: You're not the first person to think that 
	Mina: And you're definitely not the first person to think that people only talk to you out of pity!
	$> Global.expression = 'happy'
	Mina: So don't be discouraged on your venture to build these friendships!
	$> Global.expression = 'serious'
	Mina: If I may ask, why do you think that they only talk to you out of pity?
	- they become awkward when I'm around
		Mina: Oh, I see...
		$> Global.expression = 'laugh'
		Mina: Well, befriending new people will always have an awkward start!
		$> Global.expression = 'elated'
		Mina: The fact that you're still trying despite this hurdle, shows how strong you are
		Mina: Thank you for sharing your worries with me!
	- I feel like they're already so close
		Mina: ...
		- so I don't know why they'd need me
		Mina: I see...
		$> Global.expression = 'sad'
		Mina: I'm sure they talk to you because they want to, not need to!
		Mina: And it's always difficult to join an already established friend group!
		Mina: The fact that you're still trying despite this hurdle, shows how strong you are
		$> Global.expression = 'elated'
		Mina: Thank you for sharing your worries with me!
	- I don't know
		$> Global.expression = 'laugh'
		Mina: ...I can tell you're not being completely honest with me Violet!
		Mina: I won't pry, but I hope you know I'm here for you
	$> Global.expression = 'elated'
	$> Global.happiness += 30
	Mina: I'm certain it'll get easier! 
	Mina: And if it doesn't work out, you'll always have me to fall back on!
	- thanks Mina
		Mina: Anytime!
	- ...
		Mina: ...
% 
	: it's 11pm right now, and Mum is still out...
	: I'm... kinda worried about her
	: like, she hardly tells me anything about how she's doing, y'know
	: actually, I guess we hardly speak about anything ever
	: I mean, don't get me wrong, I'm grateful she works so hard and all
	: and she's never put any stress on me to get a job or take on the same stress she does
	: but still, I wish she'd just talk to me, y'know
	: I can see it takes a toll on her...
	Mina: ... [$> Global.expression = "sad"]
	Mina: Your mum does seem to be working very hard!
	Mina: And it is clear she cares about you - as she doesn't put any pressure on you to do the same
	Mina: But, you're still right to feel hurt by this
	$> Global.expression = "happy" 
	Mina: Still, I have to say, Violet, you're so kind-hearted for understanding your mother's situation!
	Mina: Many would come at this situation with anger
	$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
	Mina: But you remain understanding and empathetic
	$> Global.expression = "elated" 
	Mina: That shows how considerate you are, Violet!
	Mina: Never forget that! [$> Global.happiness += 30]
	Mina: In the mean time, I'll keep you company hehe
	- I'd like that
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Mina: Hehe, ok then!
	- I'm going to bed
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Mina: Ok!
		$> Global.expression = "elated" 
		Mina: Goodnight Violet
		- Goodnight Mina
		- ...
			Mina: ...
=> END